==Event Information==
The Battle Cats has soared to a cool 94 MILLION downloads worldwide, and it's time to celebrate!<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''On between November 18th (11:00am) and December 2nd (10:59am)!'''}}

{{Color|#FF5630|'''● Celebration Login Stamps!'''}}<br>
Get awesome rewards from daily Login Stamps!<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''On between November 18th (11:00am) and January 20th (10:59am)!'''}}<br>
Earn one stamp each day when you visit the Cat Base menu in The Battle Cats! You can earn a {{Color|#00CCFF|'''total of 9 Rare Tickets if you log in every single day during the event!'''}}<br>
Also, limited Special unit {{Color|#FF0000|'''Gold Brick Cat'''}} can also be obtained during the 30-day login period.

※Up to 30 Stamps can be earned during this event.<br>
※Activate Gold Brick Cat by visiting the Special Cats section of the Upgrade menu.<br>
※Gold Brick Cat cannot be earned again if it was claimed during the previous event.

{{Color|#FF5630|'''● Duel Stages now available!'''}}<br>
Put your honor on the line! Your strongest fighter versus one opponent in single combat!<br>
Are you ready for the Duel Stages?<br>
Visit the Special Stages section of the Legend Stages to challenge the Duel Stage.<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''On between November 18th (11:00am) and November 25th (10:59am)!'''}}

In any duel stage, you will only be able to deploy one Cat at a time against the single powerful enemy who appears! Think carefully before you choose who'll defend the honor of your Cat Army!<br>
A new fight will appear each day, so keep an eye out for the next challenger!<br>
Steel your resolve and get ready to face down your opponent!

※ If Duel Stages do not appear, make sure that your Battle Cats app is updated to the most recent version available.

{{Color|#FF5630|'''● Tag Arena Event!'''}}<br>
Seek out the summit of a massive challenge with your strongest partner in the Tag Arena.<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''On between November 25th (11:00am) and December 2nd (10:59am)!'''}}<br>
Visit Event Stages/Legend Stages from the title menu and look for {{Color|#0000FF|'''Tag Arena'''}} on the map list to challenge this limited-time event!

Tag Arena stages are special stages that are challenged in a 2 vs. 2 format! Different tactics will be necessary to complete these stages!

Duos with the best combination stand the best chance, so think carefully before sending them out into battle!

※If the event does not appear, please update to the latest version of The Battle Cats.

{{Color|#FF5630|'''● XP Festival Events!'''}}<br>
Get ready to power up your Cats to the max with the special stages Blitz XP, XP Megablitz, XP Colosseum, and Merciless XP at Legend Stages!

{{Color|#46BDC6|'''･ Blitz XP Schedule'''}}<br>
