Don't miss out on this chance!

※Regularly occurring XP events will also be be available outside of the times listed above.<br>
※ XP Megablitz is available after Empire of Cats Ch. 3 is cleared. XP Colosseum becomes available after Into the Future Ch. 1 is cleared. Merciless XP will be available after Into the Future Ch. 3 is cleared and User Rank 1600 reached. XP Bonanza will be available after Unleashing Cats is cleared.

{{Color|#FF5630|'''● Treasure Festivals Everyday!'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF9900|'''During this event, get increased Treasure Drop Rates'''}} in Story Mode chapters for a special Treasure Festival, all day every day!<br>
On even days'''}} visit {{Color|#FF00FF|'''Empire of Cats'''}}, and on odd days'''}} head to Into the Future'''}} to take advantage of this special event!<br>
Plus, don't miss the Treasure Festival for {{Color|#FF00FF|'''Cats of the Cosmos'''}} on {{Color|#0000FF|'''11/19, 11/22, 11/25, 11/28, 12/1!'''}}

※Please note: Treasure Festivals for Empire of Cats and Into the Future will appear only once Empire of Cats Ch. 1 has been cleared. The Treasure Festival for Cats of the Cosmos will appear once Into the Future Ch. 1 has been cleared.

{{Color|#FF5630|'''● Log In to earn Cat Food every day during the event!'''}}<br>
Log in during the event for exclusive log-in stamps with rewards of up to {{Color|#FF0000|'''280 Cat Food'''}}! Don't forget to check in and grab your free Cat Food while you can!

※There are 14 stamps to collect for this event.<br>
※To collect these log-in stamps, please update to the latest version of The Battle Cats.

